  "title": "Blocky yeti 2.4 m",
  "description": "A chunky blocky yeti with yellow fur and horns. Low-poly character by Quaternius (CC0 1.0, public domain), from the animated model used in the KherveOS games, here in its rest pose. 2400 mm tall (2358 x 1589 x 2400 mm), standing on z = 0, centred on x/y, facing -Y. Built as one Object of 3 coloured imported meshes (STL files in meshes/yeti/ beside this part); scale the Object to resize it. 3070 triangles.",
